# Generated HMI UI previews/resources; editable specifications remain tracked
**/doc/hmi_ui/*.png


# Frozen native build inputs are shipped in the GitHub Release source archive.
# The tracked baseline.json pins their hashes; generated databases stay local.

# Implemented-netlist audit exports are carried inside the release source zip.
